&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href='https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20251125-the-mysterious-black-fungus-from-chernobyl-that-appears-to-eat-radiation'&gt;Read Original Article&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
